Z||000000||fiero56||08-17-2001||12:41 AM||||I've got an itch to go through the Kentucky hills and tour the National Corvette Museum. Been over a year since I was last there. I think it could make for a neat "Fiero thing."<P>Best time would be end of Sept/beginning of Oct. Leave Saturday morning, tour the plant, eat, drive, etc. Wondering if there would be any interest in this with at least several Fieros showing up? I'm not a good co-oridinator, 87ECO5 has always done the work before, I nominate him. I plan to go anyway, but feel it could make for a neat Fiero group trip.<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pffsig1.jpg"> ||||reg||5
